            },
            "transition_in": "slide_left",
            "transition_out": "slide_up"
        },
        {
            "scene_id": 3,
            "narration": "1963年，气象学家洛伦兹发现：初始条件只差0.0001，两周后的结果就能差十万八千里。",
            "duration": 10,
            "visual": {
                "type": "animation",
                "title": "蝴蝶效应",
                "subtitle": "洛伦兹 · 1963",
                "animation": "fade_in",
                "components": [{
                    "type": "badge",
                    "text": "初始差0.0001",
                    "position": "top_right",
                    "color": "#F5A623"
                }]
            },
            "transition_in": "slide_up",
            "transition_out": "zoom_in"
        },
        {
            "scene_id": 4,
            "narration": "这就是蝴蝶效应：混沌系统存在有限的「可预测时间窗口」，超出窗口，再强的算力也无能为力。",
            "duration": 10,
            "visual": {
                "type": "text_card",
                "title": "可预测时间窗口",
                "subtitle": "混沌宣判的残酷事实",
                "animation": "slide_up"
            },
            "transition_in": "zoom_in",
            "transition_out": "slide_left"
        },
        {
            "scene_id": 5,
            "narration": "天气涉及无数空气分子的相互作用；足球的核心变量却很集中：22名球员、1个球、战术体系和历史数据。",
            "duration": 11,
            "visual": {
                "type": "animation",
                "title": "变量更集中",
                "subtitle": "22名球员 · 1个球 · 战术 · 数据",
                "animation": "slide_up",
                "components": [{
                    "type": "label",
                    "text": "天气 vs 足球",
                    "position": "top_center",
                    "color": "#4A90D9"
                }]
            },
            "transition_in": "slide_left",
            "transition_out": "slide_up"
        },
        {
            "scene_id": 6,
            "narration": "AI能在足球预测上做到65.7%，在天气上却只有7天。不是AI更强，而是足球的信噪比更高。",
            "duration": 10,
            "visual": {
                "type": "text_card",
                "title": "信噪比更高",
                "subtitle": "65.7% vs 7天",
                "animation": "fade_in",
                "components": [{
                    "type": "badge",
                    "text": "足球胜率65.7%",
                    "position": "top_left",
                    "color": "#F5A623"
                }]
            },
            "transition_in": "slide_up",
            "transition_out": "slide_left"
        },
        {
            "scene_id": 7,
            "narration": "Opta每场比赛采集2000到3000条事件数据，29个骨骼关键点每秒更新50帧，构成高密度信息场。",
            "duration": 11,
            "visual": {
                "type": "text_card",
                "title": "高密度信息场",
                "subtitle": "Opta · 每场比赛",
                "animation": "fade_in",
                "components": [{
                        "type": "badge",
                        "text": "2000-3000条/场",
                        "position": "top_left",
                        "color": "#F5A623"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "badge",
                        "text": "29关键点×50帧",
                        "position": "top_right",
                        "color": "#4A90D9"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "transition_in": "slide_left",
            "transition_out": "slide_up"
        },
        {
            "scene_id": 8,
            "narration": "AI在信息场里做模式识别，本质上是在混沌系统中寻找变化缓慢、影响最大的「慢变量」。",
            "duration": 9,
            "visual": {
                "type": "text_card",
                "title": "寻找慢变量",
                "subtitle": "混沌中抓住确定性",
                "animation": "slide_up"
            },
            "transition_in": "slide_up",
            "transition_out": "zoom_in"
        },
        {
            "scene_id": 9,
            "narration": "小组赛初期，AI准确率只有43.8%；随着信息密度增加，准确率爬升到64.5%。预测窗口是动态延展的。",
            "duration": 11,
            "visual": {
                "type": "chart",
                "chart_type": "bar",
                "data": {
                    "title": "准确率动态爬升",
                    "labels": ["小组赛初期", "赛程推进后"],
                    "values": [43.8, 64.5],
                    "y_axis_label": "准确率 (%)"
                },
                "animation": "fade_in",
                "components": [{
                    "type": "badge",
                    "text": "43.8% → 64.5%",
                    "position": "top_center",
                    "color": "#F5A623"
                }]
            },
            "transition_in": "zoom_in",
            "transition_out": "slide_left"
        },
        {
            "scene_id": 10,
            "narration": "但窗口之外依然是混沌：169次精确比分预测0次命中，24场平局只猜对11场。",
            "duration": 9,
            "visual": {
                "type": "chart",
                "chart_type": "bar",
                "data": {
                    "title": "窗口的边界",
                    "labels": ["平局猜对", "平局猜错"],
                    "values": [11, 13],
                    "y_axis_label": "场次"
                },
                "animation": "fade_in",
                "components": [{
                    "type": "badge",
                    "text": "169次比分预测0命中",
                    "position": "top_center",
                    "color": "#F5A623"
                }]
            },
            "transition_in": "slide_left",
            "transition_out": "slide_up"
        },
        {
            "scene_id": 11,
            "narration": "海森堡说：「我们不能知道现在的所有细节，这是一种原则性的事情。」",
            "duration": 7,
            "visual": {
                "type": "text_card",
                "title": "原则性的限制",
                "subtitle": "海森堡",
                "animation": "slide_up"
            },
            "transition_in": "slide_up",
            "transition_out": "slide_left"
        },
        {
            "scene_id": 12,
            "narration": "所以，人类能在有限窗口内做概率性预测，却不能做确定性预言。AI推宽了窗口，但抹不掉窗口外的黑暗。",
            "duration": 11,
            "visual": {
                "type": "text_card",
                "title": "窗口内的概率",
                "subtitle": "窗外，永远是黑暗",
                "animation": "bounce_in"
            },
            "transition_in": "slide_left",
            "transition_out": "fade"
        }
    ],
    "outro": {
